    "preamble": "Vulla Durga Rao vs The State Of Ap on 13 November, 2019 Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.V.S.S.Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.6507 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "1. This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner / Accused No.1 under section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioner, in FIR No.503 of 2018, on the file of the Station House Officer, Gajuwaka Police Station, Visakhapatnam. The alleged offences against the petitioner are under sections 188, 273 r/w 34 of IPC and Sections 59(I), 59(II) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
